WEBVTT

00:07:57.325 --> 00:08:00.345
We have been doing this 
across hundred thousand villages

00:08:00.345 --> 00:08:01.685
and 12 states,

00:08:01.685 --> 00:08:03.775
and we have trained millions of women.

00:08:03.775 --> 00:08:06.475
A story of one woman, Lakshmi-

00:08:06.475 --> 00:08:08.816
once she got access to a smartphone,

00:08:08.816 --> 00:08:12.456
she understood why the crops
in her village weren't doing well

00:08:12.456 --> 00:08:16.456
and she was able to find information
and help make it all better.

00:08:16.456 --> 00:08:20.456
I think, getting access to technology
is a big thing,

00:08:20.456 --> 00:08:23.426
and so we are really 
putting a lot of effort into it.

00:08:23.426 --> 00:08:25.726
I think in the next five to ten years,

00:08:25.726 --> 00:08:29.826
hopefully we can get over a billion people
with access to a smartphone.

00:08:29.826 --> 00:08:32.496
I think that can make a big difference.